        "content": "<p>I would like to run various tactics [and/or sequences] just to inspect them in the InfoView, but otherwise treat them as idempotently as <code>skip</code>.<br>\nFor example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">guard_goal_nums</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails inside</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- succeeds inside</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try?</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails inside</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">skip</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">skip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- hovering over this in the InfoView shows proof state</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">stop</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">clear</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">observing?!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">clear</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tac</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">guard_hyp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">guard_goal_nums</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>My attempts at <code>recover</code>, <code>try</code>, <code>fail_if_success</code>, and <code>.</code> sometimes work but I haven't found a consistent system. In particular, <code>try fail_if_success apply?</code> suppresses output.<br>\nPossibly I want a thin wrapper around <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.withoutModifyingState#doc\">docs#Lean.withoutModifyingState</a> , and/or <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.observing%3F#doc\">docs#Lean.observing?</a></p>",
